# Ping Pong Palace (levels/solo/pingpong.txt), the fired-up route: as the Giant Steps route up
# the chimney, then into the landing's trench for four quick nuggets and Down. Off the runway's
# end, a jump and a toot to each island, ten apart, nuggets on the arcs. At the merge the bank
# shot (jump, toot into the wall's duck, toot again at the top of its bat, up through the
# shelf), the high score table, off its end onto the kicker's ledge, back into the duck, toot
# over the drain under the net, up the duck shaft (let go of Right so both ducks bat).
